# Internal working documents (kept on the maintainer's disk, not part of the published repository). The published
# documents are README.md, THIRD_PARTY.md, docs/USER_GUIDE.md, docs/TUTORIAL.md, docs/KEYS_REFERENCE.md and the
# screenshots in docs/features/img.
/CHANGELOG.md
/docs/*
